  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYou're Barack Obama. 4 years into your retirement, you awake to find a letter with no return address on your bedside table. It reads \"I hope you've had a chance to relax Barack...but pack your bags and call the number below. It's time to start the real job.\" Signed simply, \"JFK.\"\n\nI called the number only to hear dead air. No voice. No dial tone. Nothing. My thoughts start to run rampid as the fact that JFK is even alive is mind boggling. There is no way this is the real JFK, and what would he want with me? Just as i get the image of JFK out of my head my eyes awake. I hear the phone ring. There is no number but i decide to pick up anyway. The voice was very deep and shallow. \"Are you ready?\" the voice asked?  I was thrown back by the call. \"Who is this?\" I asked. \"I am going to need some additional information from you before i agree to anything.\" The voice paused temporarily for maybe 10 seconds.",
